---
import Legal from "../../layouts/Legal.astro";

// 35 U.S.C. § 287(a) virtual marking: list each product with the patents or
// applications that cover it. Leave empty until an application is on file;
// marking "patent pending" with nothing pending is false marking (§ 292).
const patents: { product: string; numbers: string[] }[] = [];
---

<Legal title="Legal notices" description="Copyright, trademark, patent and licence notices for MOQOM, from Elliott Wave LLC.">
  <h2 id="copyright">Copyright</h2>
  <p>
    © 2026 Elliott Wave LLC. All rights reserved, except as granted by the licences below. This covers the software,
    documentation, specifications, website content, designs and media published by MOQOM and elliottwave.studio lab.
  </p>

  <h2 id="licences">Open-source and source-available licences</h2>
  <p>
    The client and backend SDKs and the security libraries (moqom-security) are licensed under the Apache License,
    Version 2.0. Each contributor's patent licence
    under section 3 of that licence covers only the claims necessarily infringed by their contribution as published,
    and ends for anyone who brings patent litigation alleging that the work infringes. The relay, control plane and
    other server components, the player and the congestion controller are proprietary: they are distributed only as
    binaries, under a written agreement with Elliott Wave LLC, and their source is not published. The licence file in
    each open-source repository is the complete grant for that repository.
  </p>

  <h2 id="reservation">Reservation of rights</h2>
  <p>
    Except for the licences expressly granted in a repository's licence file or in a signed agreement, Elliott Wave LLC
    reserves all rights in its intellectual property. No licence to any patent, trademark, copyright or trade secret
    is granted or implied by publishing code or documentation, by describing a product, by implementing or
    contributing to a public specification, or by any course of dealing. Use of the hosted MOQOM Cloud service is
    governed by the <a href="/legal/terms/">Terms of Service</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="patents">Patents</h2>
  {
    patents.length === 0 ? (
      <p>
        This page lists the patents and patent applications that cover MOQOM products, for the purposes of 35 U.S.C.
        § 287(a). It is updated as applications are filed and granted.
      </p>
    ) : (
      <>
        <p>
          The following products are covered by the patents and applications listed, for the purposes of 35 U.S.C.
          § 287(a).
        </p>
        <ul>
          {patents.map((p) => (
            <li>
              <strong>{p.product}:</strong> {p.numbers.join(", ")}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </>
    )
  }

  <h2 id="trademarks">Trademarks</h2>
  <p>
    MOQOM™, MOQOM Cloud™, six10nine™, 6(78)9™, Unify™, Kalopsia™, Elliott Wave™ and elliottwave.studio lab™, and the
    MOQOM and Elliott Wave logos, are trademarks of Elliott Wave LLC. The ™ symbol marks a claimed trademark; none of
    these marks is registered yet, and ® will be used only once a mark is registered. Other
    names are trademarks of their respective owners, and their mention implies no affiliation or endorsement. The
    open-source licences do not grant permission to use these marks, except as needed to describe the origin of the
    work (Apache License 2.0, section 6). Forks must use a different name.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contributions">Contributions</h2>
  <p>
    Contributions to Elliott Wave LLC repositories are accepted under the Contributor Licence Agreement linked from each
    repository, which assigns or licenses the contribution so the project can be licensed as described above.
  </p>

  <h2 id="copyright-complaints">Copyright complaints</h2>
  <p>
    To report material you believe infringes your copyright, write to <a href="mailto:legal@moqom.cloud">legal@moqom.cloud</a>
    with the information required by 17 U.S.C. § 512(c)(3): your signature, the work, the material and where it is, your
    contact details, a statement of good-faith belief, and a statement under penalty of perjury that the notice is
    accurate and that you are authorised to act.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>Elliott Wave LLC · <a href="mailto:legal@moqom.cloud">legal@moqom.cloud</a></p>
</Legal>
